OL,3,APeople playing loud music on buses
OL,4,Acould face #100 fine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA national campaign asking rail
OL,7,Fpassengers "share the carriage, not the
OL,8,Fnoise" is also being launched. The
OL,9,Fproposed crackdown has been welcomed by
OL,10,Fcampaigners, but some have questioned
OL,11,Fhow it can be enforced.
